mockstudio (1.2.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Postman import: requests become mock endpoints and saved examples
    become responses, into a new or an existing project.
  * Redesigned interface: icon rail, folder tree, breadcrumbs, server
    status pill, Teal light/dark and Graphite themes, and a new logo.
  * Hover help on every field, button and badge (can be turned off), and
    a phone layout with bottom navigation.
  * Fix: duplicating a project kept the original's id and file.

 -- Dhivakar R <dhivakar1010@gmail.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:30:00 +0530

mockstudio (1.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Flows tab: multi-step, concurrent traffic scenarios with live
    throughput, error rate and latency percentiles.
  * Lower memory and CPU under traffic: capped log bodies, batched UI
    updates, cached route matching and templating, pooled proxy client.
  * Fixes for proxy gzip/binary bodies, connection-reset faults, binary
    request bodies, project import ids, tunnel shutdown and atomic saves.

 -- Dhivakar R <dhivakar1010@gmail.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 02:30:00 +0530

mockstudio (1.0.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Mock Studio by dhiva labs: a production-grade mock
    server desktop app. Design HTTP endpoints visually and run a real
    shelf-based server with conditional rules, response sequences,
    weighted randomness, templating, latency and fault injection, a live
    request log, LAN + public-tunnel sharing, and OpenAPI/Postman import.

